Name "Hostile"

--敌对神经网络系统半自动化
--注: 此处半自动化指的是战利品制造器的配方需手动选择
--与AE2联动使用，输出总线加合成卡，输出到Predict容器中

--命名规则:
--Energy_Src: 能量源
--Predict: 预测矩阵提供器(抽屉与AE带合成卡的输出总线结合即可)
--Sim: 敌对神经网络模拟器
--Maker: 战利品制造器
--Storage: 推荐使用抽屉的存储控制器作为产物输出点


--能量输送
Every 1 tick do

   Input FE:: From Energy_Src Top Side
      Output FE:: To each Sim Bottom Side
      Output FE:: To each Maker Bottom Side

End

--预测矩阵输送
Every 20 ticks do

    Input hostilenetworks:prediction_matrix From Predict Top Side
        Output retain 8 each hostilenetworks:prediction_matrix To each Sim Top Side
    forget

End

--通用预测产物输送
Every 20 ticks do

    Input hostilenetworks:overworld_prediction From each Sim Top Side Slots 2
        Output hostilenetworks:overworld_prediction To Storage Bottom Side
    forget

    Input hostilenetworks:nether_prediction From each Sim Top Side Slots 2
        Output hostilenetworks:nether_prediction To Storage Bottom Side
    forget

    Input hostilenetworks:end_prediction From each Sim Top Side Slots 2
        Output hostilenetworks:end_prediction To Storage Bottom Side
    forget

    Input hostilenetworks:twilight_prediction From each Sim Top Side Slots 2
        Output hostilenetworks:twilight_prediction To Storage Bottom Side
    forget

End

--生物预测产物输送
Every 20 ticks do

    Input hostilenetworks:prediction From each Sim Top Side Slots 3
        Output hostilenetworks:prediction To each Maker Bottom Side
    forget

End

--制造器物品输送
Every 20 ticks do

    Input From each Maker Top Side Slots 1-16
        Output To Storage Bottom Side
    forget

End